:: Deadwood Park Bench
<<set $outside to 1>><<effects>>
<<if $location isnot 'park' or $combat is 1 or $replayScene or $statFreeze or $possessed or $stress gte $stressmax or $nextPassage or $nextPassageCheck>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You cannot settle on the bench now.' '你现在没法在长椅上坐下来。'>><br><br>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      A wooden bench stands beside the riverside path, its paint worn smooth along the seat. Someone has left a folded newspaper beneath one leg to stop it rocking.
      <br><br>
      <<if Weather.precipitation is 'rain'>>
        The branches catch some of the rain, but drops still patter on the seat. People hurry past with their collars turned up.
      <<elseif Weather.precipitation is 'snow'>>
        You brush snow from one end of the seat. Footprints cross the path, some ending in a dog's paw marks beside the river.
      <<elseif Time.dayState is 'night'>>
        A lamp shines through the branches. You can hear traffic beyond the trees, and footsteps now and then on the path behind you.
      <<else>>
        Joggers pass along the path. A dog strains towards the river until its owner calls it back; the lead brushes against the end of the bench.
      <</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      河边的小径旁有张木长椅，椅面上的漆已经磨得光滑。一条椅腿下垫着叠好的旧报纸，坐上去倒还稳当。
      <br><br>
      <<if Weather.precipitation is 'rain'>>
        头顶的树枝挡住了些雨，仍有水滴落在椅面上。路人竖起衣领，匆匆走过。
      <<elseif Weather.precipitation is 'snow'>>
        你拂去椅子一头的积雪。小径上留着来往的脚印，河边还混着几枚狗爪印。
      <<elseif Time.dayState is 'night'>>
        路灯从枝叶间透下来。树外传来车声，身后的小径上偶尔响起脚步。
      <<else>>
        慢跑的人沿小径经过。一条狗使劲往河边蹿，被主人叫了回来，牵绳擦过长椅的一头。
      <</if>>
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<if maplebirch.get('MoreTransformations')?.Raven.available>>
    <<lanSwitch 'Low croaks come from the trees above the bench. A few black birds have gathered on the branches.' '长椅上方传来低哑的鸣叫，几只黑鸟聚在枝头。'>><br><br>
    <<deadwood-raven-link>>
  <</if>>
  <<icon 'raven-shrine/bench.png'>><<lanLink ['Rest a while (0:15)', '歇一会儿 (0:15)'] 'Park'>>
    <<if $location is 'park' and $combat isnot 1 and !$replayScene and !$statFreeze and !$possessed and $stress lt $stressmax and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck>>
      <<set _benchSource to $passage, $eventskip to 0>><<pass 15>>
      <<if $passage is _benchSource and $location is 'park' and $combat isnot 1 and !$replayScene and !$statFreeze and !$possessed and $stress lt $stressmax and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck>>
        <<stress `Weather.precipitation is 'rain' ? -1 : -3`>><<tiredness -1>>
      <</if>>
    <</if>>
  <</lanLink>><<lstress>><<ltiredness>><br>
<</if>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the path', '回到小径上'] 'Park'>><</lanLink>><br>
